<div
	id="modalLegend"
	class="modal fade"
	tabindex="-1"
	role="dialog"
	aria-labelledby="modalLegendTitle"
	aria-hidden="true"
>
	<div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg" role="document">
		<div class="modal-content legend-modal-content">
			<div class="modal-header">
				<h4 id="modalLegendTitle" class="modal-title">L&eacute;gende des couleurs</h4>
				<button
					type="button"
					class="legend-close-button"
					data-dismiss="modal"
					aria-label="Fermer"
					title="Fermer"
				>
					<i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i>
				</button>
			</div>

			<div class="modal-body">
				<div class="legend-grid">
					<section class="legend-section" aria-labelledby="legendBackgroundTitle">
						<h5 id="legendBackgroundTitle" class="legend-section-title">Couleurs de fond</h5>
						<ul class="legend-list">
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample bck_pos" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Zone des revenus.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample bck_neg" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Zone des d&eacute;penses.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample bck_solde" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Zone des gains et des soldes.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample done" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Mois termin&eacute;.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample legend-background-current" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Mois en cours.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample legend-background-future" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Mois &agrave; venir.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample legend-background-edit" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Bordure jaune d'une zone modifiable.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-background-sample bck_black" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<span>Zone sans calcul applicable.</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</section>

					<section class="legend-section" aria-labelledby="legendTextTitle">
						<h5 id="legendTextTitle" class="legend-section-title">Couleurs du texte</h5>
						<ul class="legend-list">
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-text-sample total_month_detail_pos">123,45 &euro;</span>
								<span>D&eacute;tail d'un revenu.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-text-sample total_month_detail_neg">123,45 &euro;</span>
								<span>D&eacute;tail d'une d&eacute;pense.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-text-sample total_month_full_pos">123,45 &euro;</span>
								<span>Total, gain ou solde positif.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-text-sample total_month_full_neg">-123,45 &euro;</span>
								<span>Total, gain ou solde négatif.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-text-sample total_month_full_dec">-123,45 &euro;</span>
								<span>Solde n&eacute;gatif couvert par le d&eacute;couvert autoris&eacute;.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-text-sample anticipe">123,45 &euro;</span>
								<span>Op&eacute;ration anticip&eacute;e, clignotante si sa date est d&eacute;pass&eacute;e.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-text-sample total_month_full_neutre">0,00 &euro;</span>
								<span>Solde neutre.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-alert-sample balance-alert-current" aria-hidden="true">
									<i class="fas fa-exclamation"></i>
								</span>
								<span>Le solde actuel d&eacute;passe le d&eacute;couvert autoris&eacute;.</span>
							</li>
							<li class="legend-item">
								<span class="legend-color-sample legend-alert-sample balance-alert-projected" aria-hidden="true">
									<i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>
								</span>
								<span>Triangle blanc avec un ! rouge : le solde pr&eacute;vu &agrave; la fin du mois d&eacute;passe le d&eacute;couvert autoris&eacute;.</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</section>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="modal-footer">
				<button type="button" class="btn btn-dark" data-dismiss="modal">Fermer</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
